 "source": "c60547a52cef7485",
 "code": "def remove_nth_from_end(head: ListNode | None, n: int) -> ListNode | None:\n    dummy = ListNode(0, head)\n    lead = dummy\n    trail = dummy\n    for _ in range(n + 1):\n        lead = lead.next\n    while lead is not None:\n        lead = lead.next\n        trail = trail.next\n    trail.next = trail.next.next\n    return dummy.next\n",
